      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C3177E59053300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟人一出名就会招来各种麻烦。\n想隐姓埋名的心情也可以理解。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF4EBA4E0051FA540D5C314F1A62DB6765540479CD9EBB70E63002000A60F3969059D357CB540D76845FC360C54E5F53EF4EE5740689E3300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有话想和你这位\n有名的训练家说。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167098BDD60F3548C4F608FD94F4D000A6709540D76848BAD7EC35BB68BF4300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是个不畅销的小说家，\n但我有个不错的故事构想。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E2A4E0D7545950076845C0F8BF45BB6FF0C000A4F46621167094E2A4E0D9519768465454E8B678460F3300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "遗憾的是，我总觉得登场人物不够带劲。\n于是我希望能参考一下你这个名人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "905761BE7684662FFF0C6211603B89C95F97767B573A4EBA72694E0D591F5E2652B23002000A4E8E662F62115E0C671B80FD53C280034E004E0B4F608FD94E2A540D4EBA300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "具体来说，希望你能让我说的这些宝可梦\n加入同行队伍，然后带来给我看。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51774F5367658BF4FF0C5E0C671B4F6080FD8BA962118BF476848FD94E9B5B9D53EF68A6000A52A05165540C884C961F4F0DFF0C7136540E5E2667657ED96211770B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第1只，地面属性的宝可梦。\n第2只，学会喷射火焰的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n第3只，携带超级石的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你能让我看看这些宝可梦吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C003153EAFF0C573097625C5E602776845B9D53EF68A63002000A7B2C003253EAFF0C5B664F1A55B75C04706B713076845B9D53EF68A6300200100001BE00000A7B2C003353EAFF0C643A5E268D857EA777F376845B9D53EF68A6300200100001BE00000A4F6080FD8BA96211770B770B8FD94E9B5B9D53EF68A65417FF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就拜托你了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n让它们加入同行队伍，带来给我看吧。\n要是忘了是哪些宝可梦，尽管来问我。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
