      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E0072477F8E4E3D768468EE67973002000A4F4F572890A391CC7684001000020102000200100001BE00000A67094E0059297A81713660F35230FF1A201C62114E5F60F38D857EA78FDB53163002201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是为了寻找超级石，\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>与<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>为伴，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n决定前往精练之塔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
