      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "630167098D857EA777F37684001000020102000451FA73B05728000A0010000201020002548C001000020100000076849762524D2026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然后挑衅道：“如果能在拿出全力的\n对战中战胜我，超级石就归你了。”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136540E631188459053FF1A201C5982679C80FD572862FF51FA5168529B7684000A5BF962184E2D621880DC6211FF0C8D857EA777F35C315F524F604E863002201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "同意应战的<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>\n派出<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>来对战……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540C610F5E94621876840010000201020002000A6D3E51FA001000020100000067655BF962182026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "此时却杀出一只<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>。\n它为了夺走超级石，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n无差别地放出了喷射火焰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B6465F65374674051FA4E0053EA00100002010200033002000A5B834E3A4E86593A8D708D857EA777F3FF0C00100001BE00000A65E05DEE522B5730653E51FA4E8655B75C04706B7130FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>一边保护着<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>，\n一边忍耐着喷射火焰……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000004E008FB94FDD62A477400010000201020002FF0C000A4E008FB95FCD8010774055B75C04706B71302026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然后将<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>和<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>\n扔向了卡洛斯的海神之穴！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136540E5C060010000201020003548C0010000201020004000A625454114E8653616D1B65AF76846D77795E4E4B7A74FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掌管超级进化的<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>\n目睹了这一切。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "638C7BA18D857EA78FDB5316768400100002018B0001000A76EE77794E868FD94E005207300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā她他不但认可了<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>的实力，\n还赋予了<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>超级进化的样子！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF010159794ED64E0D4F468BA453EF4E86001000020100000076845B9E529BFF0C000A8FD88D4B4E884E8600100002010000008D857EA78FDB5316768468375B50FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人类首次实现超级进化！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA7C7B99966B215B9E73B08D857EA78FDB5316FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>看到这一幕，\n相信一切皆有可能，于是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201020002770B52308FD94E005E55FF0C000A76F84FE14E0052077686670953EF80FDFF0C4E8E662F2026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它重新决意去寻找属于自己的超级石，\n也就是<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>进化石了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8391CD65B051B3610F53BB5BFB627E5C5E4E8E81EA5DF176848D857EA777F3FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F00100002010200028FDB531677F34E86FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊～\n这会是一个很精彩的故事。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF5E000A8FD94F1A662F4E004E2A5F887CBE5F69768465454E8B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……是啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026662F554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！我写完后会拿去\n密阿雷出版社自荐的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF01621151995B8C540E4F1A62FF53BB000A5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E81EA83507684300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我对你只有感谢！\n如果小说卖得好，我还会请你帮忙的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BF94F6053EA6709611F8C22FF01000A5982679C5C0F8BF453565F97597DFF0C62118FD84F1A8BF74F605E2E5FD97684300200100002011401B50000",
